DESCRIPTION:Our summer "Late Night with the Chair" series kicks off this we
 ek. Come join your MCDP in welcoming Indiana Democratic Party Chair Mike Sc
 hmuhl for a meet and greet this Monday at 8:30PM at The Tap. Penny Githens\
 , Matt Fyfe\, and Emily Salzmann ⁠— our nominees for Indiana House District
  62\, Indiana's 9th Congressional District\, and Monroe County Circuit Cour
 t\, respectively — will join us at this joint event as we all talk about th
 e 2022 General Election.   
