CREATED:20220509T213818Z
DESCRIPTION:The Monroe County Democrats' Club will meet for lunch on Tuesda
 y\, May 17\, at DeAnglelo's Restaurant. Folks are encouraged to come a litt
 le early to place their orders\, but the program starts at noon. The progra
 m will be a celebration of the recent primary election and will honor all o
 f the candidates--successful\, or not. There will be cake! The public is in
 vited to attend. Hope to see you there! 
LAST-MODIFIED:20220509T213819Z
LOCATION:DeAngelo's Italian Creole Restaurant\, Eastland Plaza\, 2620 E 3rd
  St\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Monroe County Democrats' Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
