CREATED:20220312T033903Z
DESCRIPTION:\nThe Monroe County Democrats' Club will meet on Tuesday\, Marc
 h 22 at  DeAngelo's restaurant. Members are encouraged to meet at 11:30 so 
 they can order food before the speakers begin at noon. We will be meeting a
 t DeAngelo's for the first time in over two years--and they will continue t
 o offer a special soup and salad "package" for us. Many candidates will be 
 present to discuss their candidacies and take questions. The other 'half" o
 f the candidates for the primary race will speak at our upcoming meeting on
  April 19. We hope to see you all there--and remember to pay your $15 dues!
  The public is invited to attend. 
