CREATED:20220302T213409Z
DESCRIPTION:<blockquote><p>To kick off this year’s Bank on Bloomington seri
 es\, a panel of local&nbsp\;experts&nbsp\;will be answering your questions 
 about all things financial. Join us and learn from local professionals answ
 ering your questions about budgeting\, credit and debt management\, increas
 ing your savings\, and more.</p><p>The&nbsp\;Bank on Bloomington “Ask&nbsp\
 ;the&nbsp\;Experts” panel discussion will be held virtually on Thursday\, M
 arch 24 at 5:30pm.&nbsp\;The&nbsp\;following speakers will be attending:</p
 ></blockquote><ul><li>Lisa Piercefield\, Apprisen</li><li>Angela Kidwell\, 
 Regions Bank</li><li>Kate Livingston\, PNC Bank</li><li>Kevin Osbourne\, IU
  Credit Union</li></ul><blockquote><p>When you register\, you will have&nbs
 p\;the&nbsp\;opportunity to&nbsp\;ask&nbsp\;a question you would like answe
 red by&nbsp\;the&nbsp\;panel. While we cannot guarantee that every question
  will be answered\, we hope to get to as many as possible during&nbsp\;the&
 nbsp\;evening.</p><p>Register for&nbsp\;the&nbsp\;event by filling out our&
 nbsp\;<a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScKO6nsf3my8piWccHC
 x3lr9nbsqkxb2galQ_n30DK8e6Utfg/viewform?usp=sf_link"><u>RSVP form</u></a>. 
 We hope you will join us for this informative evening!</p></blockquote>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220312T235631Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bank on Bloomington “Ask the Experts
