DESCRIPTION:Monroe County NOW General Meeting<br>Thursday\, May 26\, 2022 0
 7:30 PM<br>ZOOM<br><br>Please join us as we discuss the recent developments
  on Roe v. Wade. And we also look to the future elections as we are joined 
 by Hiba Alami\, former ED of the Indiana Muslim Advocacy Network. Hiba was 
 instrumental in organizing statewide to affect elections\, specifically in 
 a district that flipped bc of those efforts in 2020. Join us to discuss tha
 t work and what she did to amplify voices to form a statewide network.<br><
 br>Join Zoom Meeting<br><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/88166330053?pwd=
 WDVoZjNtM2Z5R3VMVmprK0F1K05DQT09">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/8816<wbr>633005
 3?pwd=WDVoZjNtM2Z5R3VMVm<wbr>prK0F1K05DQT09</a><br><br>Meeting ID: 881 6633
  0053<br>Passcode: 300117
