DESCRIPTION:<p>The&nbsp\;Whitcomb Klinkose Group&nbsp\;which is devoted to 
 helping women candidates for the legislature and down-ballot build fundrais
 ing capacity.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><p>We focus on developing capacity and skill
 s that will serve current campaigns and beyond. Some of the areas in which 
 they consult with candidates and campaigns:</p><p></p><p>·&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Regulations\, Reporting\, Fil
 ing Deadlines</p><p>·&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;Developing a Fundraising Plan\, Finance Committee\, Organizing Fun
 draising Database&nbsp\;</p><p>·&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Connecting with trustworthy resources</p><p>·&nbsp\;&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Online/Digital Fundrai
 sing</p><p>·&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
 Organizing Fundraisers</p><p>·&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Feedback and Follow-up</p><p>We're offering a&nbsp\;<b>fr
 ee\, one-hour Zoom</b>&nbsp\;to any women candidates who are interested in 
 building their fundraising effort<i>.&nbsp\;</i>These are the dates that we
  have available:</p><p><b>Thursday\, March 24&nbsp\;</b><b>7:00 – 8:00 p.m.
  E.S.T.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b></p><p><b>Tuesday\, March 29&nbsp\;</b><b>7:00 – 
 8:00 p.m. E.S.T.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b></p><p><b>Thursday\, March 31&nbsp\;</b>
