 o our neighbors\, MCDP is hosting a winter clothing drive.</p><p></p><p>We 
 are accepting donations of new or gently used coats\, boots\, scarves\, glo
 ves\, and mittens. Please be sure all items are clean and in good condition
 .</p><p></p><p><strong>You can drop donations off to Democratic Headquarter
 s at 115 E. 2nd Street\, Suite 2 Monday-Friday 4:00 p.m. - 7:00 p.m. from D
 ecember 1 until December 23rd.</strong></p><p></p><p>Please consider joinin
 g us in providing for our neighbors in these cold winter months.</p>
