DESCRIPTION:<p>ISCI is excited to host a Civics Literacy Lab presented by M
 ADVoters. This interactive workshop will provide important\, nonpartisan in
 formation about the civic process so attendees can better advocate for them
 selves and their communities.</p><p>Participants will learn about voter eli
 gibility\, registration\, and ID laws\; 2026 election information\; the rol
 es of elected officials\; the legislative process\; and ways to take action
  in your community.</p><p>Please arrive by 2:45pm so the training can begin
  promptly at 3:00pm.</p><p>Located at:</p><p dir="ltr">Monroe County Librar
 y - Ellettsville Branch</p><p dir="ltr">600 W Temperance St</p><p dir="ltr"
 ><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesouthcentralindiana/?country=U
 S&amp\;state=IN" target="_blank">Ellettsville\, IN 47429</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260604T030307Z
