DESCRIPTION:<b>Wednesday\, May 25\, 2022 5:30 PM - 7:30 PM</b><br><i>Indian
 a Memorial Union's Alumni Hall</i><br><i>Indiana University 900 E. 7th St.<
 /i><br><i>Bloomington\, IN 47405</i><b><br></b><br><i><br></i><br><p>The Wo
 men Excel Bloomington Awards\, or WEB Awards\, was started in 2010 to recog
 nize women from Bloomington and surrounding areas who set a standard of pro
 fessionalism. Honorees have been from all types of backgrounds\, careers\, 
 and civic engagement\, but are united by their actions and initiatives that
  benefit their business and community.</p><p>The 12th Annual WEB Awards&nbs
 p\;celebration will be held on Wednesday\, May 25\, from 5:30 – 7:30 pm at 
 Indiana Memorial Union's Alumni Hall.</p><p>This year's honorees are:&nbsp\
 ;</p><p>Danielle Bruce - Director\, Freelance Artist</p><p>Jennifer Crossle
 y - Deputy Clerk\, City of Bloomington</p><p>Kaisa Goodman - Executive Assi
 stant\, Office of the Mayor\, City of Bloomington</p><p>Ashely Hazelrig - A
 ssistant Vice President and Financial Center Manager II\, First Financial B
 ank</p><p>Amy Meek - Interim Director of IU Health Community Health\, IU He
 alth</p><p>Erika Oliphant - Monroe County Prosecutor\, Monroe County\, Ind.
 </p><p>Karin St. John - Chief Operating Officer\, St. John Assoicates</p><b
 r><b>Register <a href="https://web.chamberbloomington.org/events/Women-Exce
 l-Bloomington-Awards-2016/details" id="ow1334" __is_owner="true">here</a>.<
 /b>
