  his own company\, he returned to his Indiana roots in 2003 and he and his 
 wife\, Cheryl\, now live in Clark County.</p><p></p><p>Please come join Jim
  and his friends for the Monroe County kickoff of his campaign at<strong> <
 /strong>Upland Brewing on <strong>Saturday\, July 12 from 2:00 to 4:00 pm</
 strong>. You can register for this event at:</p><p></p><p>secure.actblue.co
 m/donate/jgjuly12</p>
