DESCRIPTION:<strong>Join us on Zoom for Breakfast on Friday\, June 3 at 8:0
 0am.</strong><br><br>We have two very special guests who will become Democr
 atic Household names (if they aren't already!) by November:<br><p>These nom
 inations occur at the Indiana Democratic Party State Convention on June 18t
 h\, and then these women will be off to the races! Join us to hear about th
 eir dreams\, how they came to run for these offices\, and what they want to
  do in the office. We'll talk a bit about how the nomination process takes 
 place and learn about the convention itself\, the platform\, the agenda for
  the day of the convention\, the role of delegates and alternate delegates.
  There's room for everyone at this event. You'll learn how you can join in 
 the process.<br>(There's a note below regarding the Monroe County Delegatio
 n)<br>We really hope you can join us and help these women get a head start 
 on their campaigns!<br></p><p>Link:<strong><em></em></strong><strong><em></
 em></strong><strong><br><a href="https://www.democraticwomenscaucus.org/r?u
