DESCRIPTION:<p>The Whitcomb Klinkose Group which is devoted to helping wome
 n candidates for the legislature and down-ballot build fundraising capacity
 .  </p><p>We focus on developing capacity and skills that will serve curren
 t campaigns and beyond. Some of the areas in which they consult with candid
 ates and campaigns:</p><p></p><p>·         Regulations\, Reporting\, Filing
  Deadlines</p><p>·         Developing a Fundraising Plan\, Finance Committe
 e\, Organizing Fundraising Database </p><p>·         Connecting with trustw
 orthy resources</p><p>·         Online/Digital Fundraising</p><p>·         
 Organizing Fundraisers</p><p>·         Feedback and Follow-up</p><p>We&#39\
 ;re offering a <b>free\, one-hour Zoom</b> to any women candidates who are 
 interested in building their fundraising effort<i>. </i>These are the dates
  that we have available:</p><p><b>Thursday\, March 24 </b><b>7:00 – 8:00 p.
 m. E.S.T.   </b></p><p><b>Tuesday\, March 29 </b><b>7:00 – 8:00 p.m. E.S.T.
    </b></p><p><b>Thursday\, March 31 </b><b>7:00 – 8:00 p.m. E.S.T.   </b><
 /p><p><b><br></b></p><p></p><p>For more information\, contact:</p><p>Trish 
 Whitcomb\, 812.767.2050 <a href="mailto:t.whitcomb.sipes@gmail.com" target=
 "_blank">t.whitcomb.sipes@gmail.com</a></p><p>Mary Klinkose\, 317.514.9839 
  <a href="mailto:mklinkose5@gmail.com" target="_blank">mklinkose5@gmail.com
 </a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220312T034414Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Whitcomb Klinkose Group Training for Women Candidates
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
